! colspan=2| Dragon Shouts
|-
| colspan=2|''See [[Skyrim:Dragon Shouts|''Dragon Shouts'']] for a list of both English and Dragon Language commands''.

When Kinect is enabled, hold [[File:UESP-icon-Xbox RB.png|22px|RB]] and say any of the commands listed on the Dragon Shout page in order to activate it. To activate the shouts or powers without using Kinect, press [[File:UESP-icon-Xbox LB.png|22px|LB]]+[[File:UESP-icon-Xbox RB.png|22px|RB]]. While Kinect is disabled, use [[File:UESP-icon-Xbox RB.png|22px|RB]] in order to activate the shouts as normal.

*In order to activate the shouts, they must be unlocked at the level you are trying to use.
*Shouts can be said in English or Dragon Language.
*English shouts can be used without holding [[File:UESP-icon-Xbox RB.png|22px|RB]], while Dragon Language shouts require that [[File:UESP-icon-Xbox RB.png|22px|RB]] be held (If you're having trouble casting the shouts, try to say them in a fluent pace at a fast speed).
