|-
! colspan=2| Container Menu Only
|-
|<tt> SET LOOT LIMIT <value></tt> || Sets the value that the <tt>LOOT ITEMS</tt> voice command should use. (Value = 0, 5, 10, 25, 50, 100)
|-
|<tt>LOOT ITEMS</tt> || Takes all items from a container whose value-to-weight ratio is greater than or equal to the loot limit. For example, if the loot limit is 100, an object with a weight of .1 and value of 100, would have a value to weight ratio of 1000, so it would qualify. If the loot limit is 0, only weightless items with value are taken, i.e. gold.
